// UTF-8 Simplified Chinese settings help. Keys mirror SettingsHelp.h.
// Kept separate from the main catalog so help coverage can be audited independently.
{"Basic favors stable playback; High reduces buffering. Use Basic if audio crackles.", "基础模式优先保证播放稳定；高性能模式减小缓冲。如果声音出现爆音，请使用基础模式。"},
{"Follow plays BMS key sounds when you hit notes. Autoplay plays them with the chart; Off silences them.", "跟随模式在击打音符时播放BMS键音；自动模式随谱面播放；关闭则不播放键音。"},
{"Toggle menu, result and song-preview music. Gameplay chart BGM keeps playing.", "开关菜单、结果页和曲目试听音乐。游玩中的谱面BGM仍会播放。"},
{"Adjust the volume of all game audio together. Start low before raising it.", "统一调节游戏全部声音的音量。请先调低，再逐步增加。"},
{"Shift chart BGM and autoplay key sounds. Positive delays audio; Follow key sounds and judgement timing stay unchanged.", "调整谱面BGM与自动键音的时间。正值会延后声音；跟随键音与判定时间不变。"},
{"Save audio changes and return to the previous screen.", "保存音频设置并返回上一页。"},
{"Reduce volume differences between songs. This can change perceived loudness.", "减小不同曲目之间的音量差异。开启后听感音量可能变化。"},
{"WASAPI uses Windows audio. ASIO requires a compatible installed driver and device.", "WASAPI使用Windows音频；ASIO需要兼容的设备和已安装的驱动。"},
{"Choose the ASIO device driver. Press F5 to refresh the installed driver list.", "选择ASIO设备驱动。按F5刷新已安装的驱动列表。"},
{"Choose the audio sample rate supported by your device. Unsupported ASIO rates may fail to start.", "选择设备支持的音频采样率。ASIO不支持的采样率可能导致启动失败。"},
{"Smaller buffers reduce delay but can cause crackling. Increase the value if playback breaks up.", "较小的缓冲可降低延迟，但也可能产生爆音。声音断续时请增大此值。"},
{"Mute game audio while another window is active. Audio returns when you focus TenRiff.", "其他窗口处于活动状态时静音。返回TenRiff后恢复声音。"},
{"Choose title-screen music: default, random BMS, last played, or none.", "选择标题画面音乐：默认、随机BMS、上次游玩的曲目或无。"},
{"After the last judgement, listen to the remaining audio or skip it after the result delay. Notes and scoring stay unchanged.", "最后一次判定后，听完剩余音乐，或等待结果延时后跳过。音符与计分不变。"},
{"Adjust BMS accompaniment, keysounds and previews together. Default: 20%. TenRiff menu music is independent.", "统一调节BMS伴奏、键音和试听音量，默认20%。TenRiff菜单音乐单独调节。"},
{"Adjust TenRiff menu and result music. 100% uses a quiet 12.5% reference level; BMS songs are unchanged.", "调节TenRiff菜单与结果音乐。100%对应原始音量的12.5%基准，不影响BMS曲目。"},
{"Choose windowed, borderless, or fullscreen display.", "选择窗口、无边框或全屏显示模式。"},
{"Use +/- for presets, or Enter to type Width and Height (320-8192). Drag a Windowed border to resize and save. The display keeps its proportions.", "用-/+选择预设，或按Enter输入宽度和高度（320–8192）。拖动窗口边框可调整并保存尺寸，画面保持原有比例。"},
{"Set the frame-rate limit when VSync is off. Menus remain capped at 300 FPS.", "设置关闭垂直同步时的帧率上限。菜单仍以300 FPS为上限。"},
{"Match presentation to the monitor to reduce tearing. This may add display latency.", "让画面显示与显示器同步以减少撕裂，可能增加显示延迟。"},
{"Show FPS and frame-time statistics. Use the graph to check stutters.", "显示FPS与帧时间统计，可通过图表检查卡顿。"},
{"Enable chart background images and video. Turn this off to reduce visual distraction and load.", "显示谱面背景图片和视频。关闭可减少视觉干扰和运行负载。"},
{"Allow BGA behind the note lanes. Turn it off if the chart becomes difficult to read.", "允许在音符轨道后显示BGA。如果影响读谱，请关闭。"},
{"Choose how background images are enlarged. ONNX uses a local model and adds GPU processing.", "选择背景图片的放大方式。ONNX使用本地模型，会增加GPU运算。"},
{"Select a local ONNX or supported Safetensors model for background upscaling.", "选择用于背景放大的本地ONNX或受支持的Safetensors模型。"},
{"Residual adds AI corrections to the enlarged original. Complete Image uses model RGB directly. Auto recognizes the legacy residual contract or model metadata.", "残差模式在放大的原图上添加AI修正；完整图像模式直接使用模型RGB输出。自动模式识别旧残差格式或模型元数据。"},
{"Prefer the lower-power DirectX adapter for ONNX background upscaling. This does not select the main renderer's GPU.", "ONNX背景放大优先使用低功耗DirectX适配器，不会更改主渲染器使用的GPU。"},
{"Save graphics settings and return.", "保存图形设置并返回。"},
{"RawInput receives Windows key events. Polling checks key state repeatedly; use it if RawInput is incompatible.", "RawInput接收Windows按键事件；Polling反复检查按键状态。RawInput不兼容时可尝试Polling。"},
{"Set the key polling frequency. Higher rates cost more CPU. During play this also controls RawInput's bound-key backup checks.", "设置按键轮询频率。频率越高，CPU占用越大。游玩时也控制RawInput已绑定按键的辅助检查频率。"},
{"0 ms keeps fast repeats. Above 0, a same-key press before the interval after release is blocked; release stays immediate. Intentional fast repeats may be blocked too. Keyboard only; XInput is unchanged.", "0 ms保留快速连按。大于0时，松键后未满设定间隔的同键再次按下会被拦截，松键仍立即处理。有意的快速连按也可能被拦截。仅适用于键盘，不影响XInput。"},
{"Save input settings and apply backend changes on return.", "保存输入设置并返回，同时应用输入方式的更改。"},
{"Choose the number of milliseconds changed by one adjustment.", "选择每次调整所改变的毫秒数。"},
{"Shift the input timestamp used for judgement. Change in small steps while checking EARLY/LATE feedback.", "调整用于判定的输入时间戳。请观察EARLY/LATE反馈，小幅调整。"},
{"Positive values draw notes further ahead in time. This changes the display only, not judgement or audio.", "正值会让音符提前显示。仅改变画面，不影响判定或声音时间。"},
{"Reset input, visual, and sound offsets to 0 ms.", "将输入、视觉和声音偏移全部重置为0 ms。"},
{"Save timing offsets and return.", "保存时间偏移并返回。"},
{"Safe builds hashes, previews and difficulty. Fast indexes basic song metadata only; tables switch it back to Safe.", "安全模式生成哈希、预览和难度；快速模式仅索引基础曲目信息。选择难度表会切回安全模式。"},
{"Calculate native LV/CR during Safe indexing. Fast indexing always skips this calculation.", "在安全索引时计算原生LV/CR。快速索引始终跳过此计算。"},
{"Compare your play with the best compatible saved replay in a split view.", "在分屏中将当前表现与最佳兼容录像进行比较。"},
{"Let the game hit notes automatically. The result is marked ASSIST.", "由游戏自动击打音符，结果会标记为ASSIST。"},
{"Continue after gauge failure. Judgements and the final result are still recorded.", "血条耗尽后仍继续练习，判定与最终结果仍会记录。"},
{"End on the first OD8 MISS. Empty-key POOR does not count. This disables No Fail.", "首次出现OD8 MISS时结束游玩，空击POOR不计入。开启后会关闭No Fail。"},
{"Show the live accuracy gap or score gap against the target pace. Normal gauge failure and scoring remain active; otherwise eligible records still count.", "实时显示与目标准确率或当前进度目标分数的差距。仍按正常血条和计分规则处理；满足其他条件的记录依然有效。"},
{"Set the target for the selected Pacemaker mode. Enable Pacemaker first.", "设置当前目标线模式的目标准确率或分数。请先开启目标线。"},
{"Original keeps the chart's lanes. A numbered mode converts the pattern to that key count.", "原始模式保留谱面的轨道布局；选择数字键数会将谱面转换为对应键数。"},
{"Choose the pattern conversion method. Compare the preview and pick the layout that feels comfortable.", "选择谱面转换方式。请查看预览，选择适合自己的布局。"},
{"Choose the nK2 conversion preset. This setting is unavailable with Krrcream.", "选择nK2转换预设。使用Krrcream时无法更改此项。"},
{"Choose the starting gauge. Gauge shifting follows the selected play mode's rules.", "选择起始血条类型。后续血条切换遵循当前游玩模式的规则。"},
{"Rearrange note lanes. Mirror reverses lanes; random modes change the pattern using a seed.", "重新排列音符轨道。镜像会左右翻转；随机模式根据种子改变布局。"},
{"Set a repeatable pattern seed. Modes marked Auto choose a fresh seed each play.", "设置用于复现布局的种子。标记为自动的模式每次游玩都会选择新种子。"},
{"Open gameplay modifiers. Their effects and score multipliers are shown in the next screen.", "打开游玩修改选项。下一页会显示效果与分数倍率。"},
{"Change song speed and timing together. 1.00x is original speed; this also affects score eligibility.", "同时改变曲目播放速度和音符时间。1.00x为原速，也会影响记录资格。"},
{"Change note scrolling speed without changing song speed or judgement timing.", "仅改变音符滚动速度，不改变曲速或判定时间。"},
{"Save mode settings and return.", "保存模式设置并返回。"},
{"Choose Normal, Hard or EX. Hard uses the complete Normal NM row; EX uses the complete Normal VHD row, regardless of chart RANK and without rounding. Normal VEZ uses EZ timing.", "选择Normal、Hard或EX判定范围。Hard完整采用Normal NM行，EX完整采用Normal VHD行，不受谱面RANK影响且不取整。Normal VEZ与EZ相同。"},
{"Choose the key layout to edit and preview. Each layout keeps its own lane settings.", "选择要编辑和预览的键位布局。各布局分别保存轨道设置。"},
{"Choose 7+1 in Key Mode above to move the scratch lane left or right. Other layouts keep this option disabled.", "在上方键数模式中选择7+1后，可将转盘轨道移到左侧或右侧。其他布局无法使用此项。"},
{"Choose Native, TenRiff skin.json, or an imported LR2 skin.", "选择Native、TenRiff skin.json或已导入的LR2皮肤。"},
{"Choose an installed skin for the selected source and layout.", "为当前来源和键位布局选择已安装的皮肤。"},
{"Set the LR2 skin's reference resolution so its images keep the intended proportions.", "设置LR2皮肤的参考分辨率，使图片保持原本设计的比例。"},
{"Choose a skin folder or supported skin file to import.", "选择要导入的皮肤文件夹或受支持的皮肤文件。"},
{"Create a new editable skin template in the skin folder.", "在皮肤文件夹中创建可编辑的新皮肤模板。"},
{"Open the active TenRiff skin folder. First use Create New Skin, or import a skin.json folder and select Skin Source: TenRiff plus its installed skin.", "打开当前TenRiff皮肤文件夹。请先创建新皮肤，或导入skin.json文件夹，再选择TenRiff皮肤来源及对应已安装皮肤。"},
{"Reload an active imported TenRiff skin after editing (F5). Create or import a skin first, then select Skin Source: TenRiff and the installed skin.", "编辑后按F5重新加载当前导入的TenRiff皮肤。请先创建或导入皮肤，再选择TenRiff来源及已安装皮肤。"},
{"Select a lane from left to right: 1-9, 0=10, Shift+1-6=11-16. Arrows still cycle lanes.", "按从左到右的顺序选择轨道：1–9，0代表10，Shift+1–6代表11–16。方向键仍可循环选择。"},
{"Select the gap between lanes to adjust.", "选择要调整的轨道间隙。"},
{"Set the selected lane's note color. Single Color can override this palette.", "设置所选轨道的音符颜色。单色模式可覆盖此配色。"},
{"Use one shared note color across lanes, or turn this off to use lane colors.", "为所有轨道使用同一种音符颜色；关闭后使用各轨道颜色。"},
{"Choose the note-head shape for the native note style.", "选择原生音符样式的头部形状。"},
{"Show or hide the note outline to separate notes from the background.", "显示或隐藏音符描边，以便与背景区分。"},
{"Keep the source image's aspect ratio or fit it to the note area.", "保持原图宽高比，或缩放以填满音符区域。"},
{"Show or hide the vertical lines between lanes.", "显示或隐藏轨道之间的竖线。"},
{"Show or hide the line where notes are judged.", "显示或隐藏音符判定线。"},
{"Show or hide the gear boundary around the playfield.", "显示或隐藏游玩区域周围的挡板边界。"},
{"Show the end cap of long notes so release timing is easier to see.", "显示长音符尾端标记，使松键时机更清楚。"},
{"Taper the long-note tail instead of keeping a constant width.", "让长音符尾部逐渐变窄，而不是保持固定宽度。"},
{"Apply a preset combination of skin visual settings.", "应用一组预设皮肤视觉设置。"},
{"Adjust how opaque the lane background is. Higher values hide more of the BGA.", "调节轨道背景的不透明度。数值越高，遮住的BGA越多。"},
{"Adjust note visibility. Lower opacity makes notes more transparent.", "调节音符可见程度。不透明度越低，音符越透明。"},
{"Adjust the strength of note outlines.", "调节音符描边的强度。"},
{"Adjust long-note body opacity independently of its head.", "单独调节长音符主体不透明度，不影响头部。"},
{"Adjust the glow at the judgement line when a lane is active.", "调节轨道激活时判定线的发光强度。"},
{"Choose the effect displayed when a note is hit.", "选择击中音符时显示的特效。"},
{"Toggle the visual pulse on pressed keys.", "开关按键按下时的视觉脉冲效果。"},
{"Show a background panel behind the key area.", "在按键区域后显示背景面板。"},
{"Adjust the key background's opacity.", "调节按键背景的不透明度。"},
{"Move key labels above or below the key area.", "将键名移到按键区域上方或下方。"},
{"Move the judgement line vertically. The preview shows the new hit position.", "上下移动判定线，预览会显示新的击打位置。"},
{"Adjust the width of the selected lane.", "调节所选轨道的宽度。"},
{"Adjust note width for this key layout.", "调节当前键位布局的音符宽度。"},
{"Adjust the selected gap between lanes.", "调节所选的轨道间隙。"},
{"Adjust the thickness of lane divider lines.", "调节轨道分隔线的粗细。"},
{"Adjust the space between the two halves of the 16K layout.", "调节16K布局左右两部分之间的间距。"},
{"Adjust long-note body width independently of note heads.", "单独调节长音符主体宽度，不影响音符头部。"},
{"Set note height from 50% to 400%. Larger notes can overlap in dense patterns.", "在50%至400%之间设置音符高度。较大的音符可能在密集谱面中重叠。"},
{"Move the combo display up or down.", "上下移动连击显示。"},
{"Use a black playfield behind the lanes to improve note contrast.", "在轨道后使用黑色游玩背景，提高音符对比度。"},
{"Choose the font used by the skin UI.", "选择皮肤界面使用的字体。"},
{"Positive values advance note visuals. Judgement and audio timing remain unchanged.", "正值会提前显示音符，判定与声音时间不变。"},
{"Adjust the small visual gap between neighboring notes.", "调节相邻音符之间的小间隙。"},
{"Show or hide the mouse cursor during gameplay.", "显示或隐藏游玩中的鼠标指针。"},
{"Show FAST/SLOW text independently of the timing bar.", "单独显示FAST/SLOW文字，不受时间条开关影响。"},
{"Save skin adjustments and return.", "保存皮肤调整并返回。"},
{"Move judgement text vertically.", "上下移动判定文字。"},
{"Move judgement text horizontally.", "左右移动判定文字。"},
{"Move the combo display horizontally.", "左右移动连击显示。"},
{"Save the skin settings and assets as a portable .trskin file.", "将皮肤设置和素材保存为便携式.trskin文件。"},
{"Load skin settings and assets from a .trskin file.", "从.trskin文件加载皮肤设置和素材。"},
{"Open the bundled offline skin editor in your browser.", "在浏览器中打开随附的离线皮肤编辑器。"},
{"Adjust the combo text size.", "调节连击文字大小。"},
{"Adjust the judgement text size.", "调节判定文字大小。"},
{"Adjust how bright the key background becomes on a hit.", "调节击打时按键背景的亮度。"},
{"Adjust the vertical size of the key background panel.", "调节按键背景面板的高度。"},
{"Show the timing bar independently of FAST/SLOW text.", "单独显示时间条，不受FAST/SLOW文字开关影响。"},
{"Move FAST/SLOW text on the X axis in base pixels.", "以基准像素为单位左右移动FAST/SLOW文字。"},
{"Move FAST/SLOW text on the Y axis in base pixels.", "以基准像素为单位上下移动FAST/SLOW文字。"},
{"Move FAST/SLOW bar on the X axis in base pixels.", "以基准像素为单位左右移动FAST/SLOW条。"},
{"Move FAST/SLOW bar on the Y axis in base pixels.", "以基准像素为单位上下移动FAST/SLOW条。"},
{"Black fog at the top makes notes fade in. 0% is off; higher values extend the fog toward the judgement line.", "顶部黑色雾区使音符逐渐显现。0%为关闭；数值越高，雾区越向判定线延伸。"},
{"Black fog above the judgement line makes notes fade out. 0% is off; the judgement line, keys and HUD stay visible.", "判定线上方的黑色雾区使音符逐渐消失。0%为关闭；判定线、按键和HUD仍然可见。"},
{"Choose Classic or Studio Deck for Native or imported LR2 solo gameplay. Other image skins, ghost battles and multiplayer keep the classic layout.", "为Native或导入的LR2单人游玩选择Classic或Studio Deck。其他图片皮肤、录像对战和多人模式保留经典布局。"},
{"After non-PG shows timing for 0.75 seconds. Always retains the last FAST/SLOW text and marker; text and bar visibility stay independent.", "非PG判定后显示0.75秒。始终显示会保留最后的FAST/SLOW文字及标记；文字和时间条可分别开关。"},
{"Show or hide the chart-density graph and its clock to the left of the Studio Deck playfield. This does not change the Classic HUD.", "显示或隐藏Studio Deck游玩区域左侧的谱面密度图及其时钟，不影响Classic HUD。"},
{"Show or hide the backing behind FAST/SLOW and timing indicators. Judgement remains text-only.", "显示或隐藏FAST/SLOW与时间指示器后面的底板。判定始终仅显示文字。"},
{"Scale FAST/SLOW text from 50% to 200% independently of judgement, combo and the bar.", "在50%至200%之间调整FAST/SLOW文字大小，独立于判定、连击和时间条。"},
{"Scale the timing bar and its markers from 50% to 200% without changing FAST/SLOW text.", "在50%至200%之间调整时间条及标记大小，不改变FAST/SLOW文字。"},
{"Choose a local TTF/OTF font. Missing files use the default font.", "选择本地TTF/OTF字体。文件缺失时使用默认字体。"},
{"Choose the interface language. The change is applied and saved immediately.", "选择界面语言，更改后立即应用并保存。"},
{"Increase menu text size if labels are difficult to read.", "如果标签难以看清，可增大菜单文字。"},
{"Press Enter or F2 to choose a songs folder. You can also drop a folder onto the window.", "按Enter或F2选择曲目文件夹，也可将文件夹拖入窗口。"},
{"Press Enter to edit the name shown in records and multiplayer.", "按Enter编辑记录和多人模式中显示的昵称。"},
{"Choose a local PNG or JPG image for your profile.", "选择本地PNG或JPG图片作为头像。"},
{"Remove the profile image selection. The original image file is kept.", "取消头像选择，保留原始图片文件。"},
{"Save key bindings, audio/input settings and the active skin to one .trprofile file for the next version. Accounts and library/history paths are excluded.", "将按键绑定、音频/输入设置和当前皮肤保存为一个.trprofile文件，供下一版本使用。不包含账号及曲库、历史记录路径。"},
{"Apply a .trprofile settings file. Existing config/keymap files are backed up under settings-backups before import.", "导入.trprofile设置文件。导入前会将现有config/keymap文件备份到settings-backups。"},
{"Skip the opening 3, 2, 1 in solo play. Resume and multiplayer keep 3 seconds; the chart lead-in stays unchanged.", "跳过单人游玩开场的3、2、1倒数。暂停恢复与多人模式仍保留3秒，谱面开始前的留白不变。"},
{"Enter assigns an unused key. Esc cancels; Delete clears. Restart a solo song without the opening countdown; disabled in multiplayer and Session Mix. Release before using again.", "按Enter指定未使用的按键，Esc取消，Delete清除。可不经开场倒数重新开始单人曲目；多人和Session Mix中无效。再次使用前请先松键。"},
{"Assign the Hi-Speed -10 key (default F5). Enter assigns; Esc cancels; Delete clears. One step per press.", "指定Hi-Speed -10按键，默认F5。Enter指定，Esc取消，Delete清除。每次按下调整一次。"},
{"Assign the Hi-Speed +10 key (default F6). Enter assigns; Esc cancels; Delete clears. One step per press.", "指定Hi-Speed +10按键，默认F6。Enter指定，Esc取消，Delete清除。每次按下调整一次。"},
{"Finish setup and return. Your changes have already been saved.", "完成设置并返回，更改已保存。"},
{"Go to the title screen. You can reopen these settings from Options.", "返回标题画面，可从选项中重新打开这些设置。"},
{"DP Flip swaps the left and right sides of a double-play layout.", "DP Flip会交换双打布局的左右两侧。"},
{"Add notes at the selected percentage to practice denser patterns.", "按所选比例添加音符，用于练习更密集的谱面。"},
{"Choose Full LN, LN Mix, or Full Tap. Full Tap converts long notes and uses a 0.50 score multiplier.", "选择Full LN、LN Mix或Full Tap。Full Tap将长音符转换为单点音符，分数倍率为0.50。"},
{"No LN Release removes long-note release judgement; continue holding notes through their ends.", "No LN Release移除长音符松键判定；请持续按住直到尾端。"},
{"Auto Scratch plays only BMS scratch lanes. Practice assistance: score multiplier 0%, no official best or ranking. Keyboard lanes remain manual.", "Auto Scratch只自动处理BMS转盘轨道。这是练习辅助，分数倍率0%，不计入官方最佳记录或排名。普通键盘轨道仍需手动输入。"},
{"Hide scratch columns only while Auto Scratch is enabled; other key widths remain unchanged.", "仅在Auto Scratch开启时隐藏转盘轨道，其他按键宽度不变。"},
{"Assign a primary and optional secondary key for each lane. Enter opens key settings.", "为每条轨道指定主按键及可选的辅助按键。按Enter打开按键设置。"},
{"Choose a skin and adjust notes, lane spacing, and hit effects with a live preview.", "选择皮肤，并通过实时预览调整音符、轨道间距和击打特效。"},
{"Set display mode, resolution, VSync and background images.", "设置显示模式、分辨率、垂直同步和背景图片。"},
{"Set BMS key sounds, music volume and your audio device. Reduce the buffer only if playback is stable.", "设置BMS键音、音乐音量和音频设备。请仅在播放稳定时减小缓冲。"},
{"Adjust input, visual and sound offsets separately. Start at 0 ms and change one setting at a time.", "分别调整输入、视觉和声音偏移。建议从0 ms开始，每次只调整一项。"},
{"Set language, text size, nickname, profile image and songs folder.", "设置语言、文字大小、昵称、头像和曲目文件夹。"},
{"Change judgement windows and note patterns. Check the score multiplier when enabling a modifier.", "改变判定范围和音符排列。开启修改选项时请确认分数倍率。"},
{"Hold several keys to check simultaneous input. Left tests fewer keys; Right tests more (4K to 16K).", "同时按住多个键以测试同时输入。左方向键减少测试键数，右方向键增加，范围4K至16K。"},
{"The displayed mapping is used for this test only. Esc returns.", "显示的键位仅用于本次测试，按Esc返回。"},
{"Left/Right chooses the layout to edit (4K-16K). Each mode keeps its own mapping.", "用左右方向键选择要编辑的布局（4K–16K）。每种模式分别保存键位。"},
{"Left/Right selects primary or secondary. Enter starts key capture; press the new key to save. Delete clears a secondary binding.", "用左右方向键选择主按键或辅助按键。按Enter开始录入，再按新键保存。Delete清除辅助绑定。"},
{"Reset this layout's primary and secondary keys to defaults and save immediately.", "将当前布局的主按键和辅助按键恢复默认并立即保存。"},
{"Return to the previous screen. Key assignments were saved when entered.", "返回上一页，录入的按键绑定已保存。"},
{"Enable local ONNX background upscaling. It adds processing work; disable it if frame times worsen.", "启用本地ONNX背景放大。此功能会增加运算量，帧时间变差时请关闭。"},
{"Keep the current background rendering without ONNX upscaling.", "保持当前背景渲染，不启用ONNX放大。"},
{"Left / Right: adjust this value.", "左/右：调整此值。"},
{"Enter: select this action.", "Enter：执行此操作。"},
{"Unavailable in the current mode.", "当前模式下不可用。"},

{"Assign a function shortcut. Enter captures a key, Esc cancels, Delete clears. Duplicate and lane keys are rejected; hints follow the assigned key.", "指定功能快捷键。Enter开始设置，Esc取消，Delete清除。不能使用重复或轨道按键；提示会显示当前按键。"},
{"Assign the Note Speed x0.5 key (default F5). Enter assigns; Esc cancels; Delete clears. One step per press.", "指定音符速度乘0.5的按键（当前F5）。Enter设置、Esc取消、Delete清除。每次按下仅执行一次。"},
{"Assign the Note Speed x2 key (default F6). Enter assigns; Esc cancels; Delete clears. One step per press.", "指定音符速度乘2的按键（当前F6）。Enter设置、Esc取消、Delete清除。每次按下仅执行一次。"},
{"After judgement includes maximum hits. Always keeps the indicator and latest FAST/SLOW text; maximum hits refresh it and 0ms clears it. Each dot or barcode expires after 0.7 seconds.", "判定后模式包含最高判定。常显模式保留刻度和最新FAST/SLOW，最高判定也更新，0ms清除文字。每个点或竖线在0.7秒后消失。"},
{"Choose gameplay and BMS preview output. F5 refreshes; Back applies. Menu/result music uses System Default. ASIO has its own selector.", "选择游玩和BMS试听输出。F5刷新，返回时应用。菜单与结果音乐使用系统默认，ASIO单独选择。"},
{"Choose round dots or straight vertical barcode markers. Each judgement marker disappears after 0.7 seconds.", "选择圆点或竖直条形。每个判定标记在0.7秒后消失。"},

    {"Show PG / GR / G / BAD / PR counts below the timing indicator inside the field. Counts remain visible between hits. Default: Off.", "在轨道内指示器正下方显示PG / GR / G / BAD / PR累计数量，击打间隔仍显示。默认关闭。"},
